    "### Passo 5: Implantar o Container Web da Fábrica Smart N1 (Projetos 01 & 04)\n",
    "Agora executamos o container Nginx web server mapeando a porta 80 do host EC2 para a porta 80 do container."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Passo 5.1: Execucao do container Hello Web na porta 80\n",
    "!sudo docker run -d --name hello-web-smartn1 --restart always -p 80:80 nginx:alpine"
   ]
